                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not a single sex scene in chapter 1. No idea if it's planned for later chapters but this is literally nothing but an introduction. Which would be fine, but there has been no updates in months. The missing DLC for their title Mutiny has also still not been released.\n\nI really REALLY like their content, but it seems more and more that this is another case of a creator who just can't follow through. It's GalaxyPink all over again. Wait until the entire series is released, they just don't have a good history in terms of actually finishing their games.\n\nOh and the creator/artist also tried to scam me for a commission, where they basically didn't do anything for over 2 months and then pretended to be shocked when I refunded the money.\n\nStay away.",
